#: src/addeditblog.cpp:281
msgid ""
"Fetching the blog id timed out. Check your Internet connection,and your homepage URL, username or password.\n"
"Note that the URL has to contain \"http://\"\n"
"If you are using a self-hosted Wordpress blog, you have to enable Remote Publishing in its configuration."
